      "title": "LENR-Sim Swarm overview",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Infra + performance (Prometheus)\n\n- Health: blackbox → overlay backend, `api-staging`, Compose share\n- Edge: Traefik metrics on overlay `:8082`\n- Hosts: `node_exporter` (global) · Containers: `cadvisor` (global)\n- **User / product metrics:** PostHog (env-gated) — not scraped here\n- Do **not** treat uptime as closing `EQ-OPEN-*`\n\nTopology: `docs/v0.3.8-beta/THREE_NODE_SWARM_TOPOLOGY.md` · D4S for task detail"
      }
    },
    {
